{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"# BossAI｜主流程图\n原激活/资源接口已编译，普通Mesh/Cleanup/Completed A→完整返回→B有限通过；原严格raw失败保留。配置/选招与Encounter专项为历史有限证据，正式BT战斗/资产/PIE网络及完整E9待验。D–F为目标。\n[[GGYGO_结构_BossAI.canvas|结构图]] · [[BossAI/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Boss选招.canvas|选招]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Boss换形态.canvas|换形态目标]]","x":0,"y":0,"width":1800,"height":175,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"spawn","type":"text","text":"## 1. Authority请求SpawnBoss\n已有对象/创建记录、装配/清理中、销毁或EndPlay后 → 拒绝false。\n有效Definition → Spawn State并立即记创建责任，InitializeFromDefinition。\nSpawn Controller并立即记录，InitializeDecisionStream(Seed)。\nDeferred Spawn初始Avatar并立即记录，SetPawnData。\n每次关键回调后复核Encounter/记录/对象，失败走统一回滚。","x":0,"y":405,"width":410,"height":365,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bind","type":"text","text":"## 2. 完成装配并核对\nState::AttachAvatar(Pawn) → PawnExtension::InitializeAbilitySystem(ASC, State)。\nFinishSpawningActor → Avatar初始化。\nController::Possess → 关联Pawn，并启动已配置BT。\n各回调后复核创建记录/对象/当前关联；一致后发布BossState/Controller/Avatar并返回true。\n清理/EndPlay已发生 → 旧调用栈不得发布成功。","x":490,"y":405,"width":410,"height":365,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"brain","type":"text","text":"3. BT 选择并保存一次请求。\nChooseBossAction::ExecuteTask → ActionSet::ValidateConfiguration → Tag/目标/GAS 准入 → Controller::SelectAction。\nStoreActionSelection 保存来源及原 Spec，Blackboard 写 Tag。\n[[GGYGO_流程_Boss选招.canvas|校验、耗尽与消费分支]]","x":980,"y":405,"width":420,"height":320,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ga","type":"text","text":"## 4. 原GAS动作与完成\nBT消费原Spec，先订阅原Completed。\nTryActivateAbilityWithTerminationBoundary\n→ 固定Original/同步原历史；Busy不排队。\nfinal ActivateAbility → InitializeAbilityActivation\n→ ActivateAbilityBody（BP/校验/Commit）。\nN0原Task包、Owned窗口/命中token，\n原World watchdog、可选原CMC动作句柄。\nResolveDamageGameplayEffect → Builder/GAS；\n覆盖优先，共享显式bool默认false。\n缺GE/构造失败→拒当前hit伤害/Cue；\n有效载荷免疫仍Cue，不强制结束Boss。\n正常RequestAbilityEnd；中断/超时\nRequestAbilityCancel → 统一final终止入口。\nCleanupAbilityResourcesForTermination(Context)\n→ 匹配原身份、先退休再归还原资源。\nASC于原终止/相关Try完整返回后发Completed；\nBT匹配原历史，脱订阅再FinishLatentTask。\n[[BossAI/结构|完整接口/边界]] · [[AbilitySystem/计划_原请求终止|核心契约]]","x":1480,"y":405,"width":420,"height":560,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"future","type":"text","text":"D–F 目标：目标/仇恨、阶段与形态切换事务。\n[[GGYGO_流程_Boss换形态.canvas|换形态目标子图]]\n\n计划接口尚未落地：Phase 转换锁、目标服务、换 Pawn 事务；此节点不是当前 C++ 调用链。","x":980,"y":972,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"persist","type":"text","text":"换形态时应保留 BossState 的属性、Buff、冷却和 AI 目标；当前完整事务未实现。\n\n目标不变量：DetachAvatar(OldPawn) / AttachAvatar(NewPawn) 不重建 ASC，Buff/冷却在 State 延续。","x":1480,"y":972,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"cleanup-trigger","type":"text","text":"## 引擎触发Encounter EndPlay\nEndPlay(Reason) → bEndingPlay=true → CleanupCreatedBoss → Super::EndPlay。\n结束后所有SpawnBoss请求拒绝。\n当前测试显式调用真实EndPlay；PIE/世界卸载派发待验。\n[[BossAI/结构|回收边界]]","x":0,"y":905,"width":410,"height":285,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"spawn-rollback","type":"text","text":"## 装配检查失败 / 回调已清理\nSpawnBoss::FailSpawn → CleanupCreatedBoss → 返回false。\n无效PawnClass、生成/关联失败或关键回调后失效均回滚已记录对象。\n入口门禁/缺Definition直接false，无本次创建资源。\n未EndPlay且回滚完毕可重试；回调重入Spawn拒绝。","x":490,"y":905,"width":410,"height":310,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"cleanup-clear","type":"text","text":"## 回收1：守卫、快照、清引用\nCleanupCreatedBoss：已在清理则返回。\n进入bCleaningUpBoss守卫，快照三创建对象。\n清BossState/Controller/Avatar与Created记录，再调用生命周期接口。\n公开引用虽空，清理重入Spawn仍拒绝；重复清理无资源副作用。","x":0,"y":1450,"width":410,"height":315,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"cleanup-stop","type":"text","text":"## 回收2：先请求Brain停止\n有效创建Controller → ClearActionSelection。\nGetBrainComponent有效 → StopLogic(Reason)。\n先于UnPossess、Detach与Destroy。\n测试Brain只观察入口；实际BT SafeStop/异步Abort是否完成仍待验证，调用返回不作为完成证据。","x":490,"y":1450,"width":410,"height":315,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"cleanup-unpossess","type":"text","text":"## 回收3：解除Controller/Pawn\n复核创建Controller仍有效且有Pawn → UnPossess。\n可能解除外部当前Avatar的关系。\nController的OnUnPossess只PauseLogic；最终停止已由上一步发起。\n回调可能销毁对象，下一步重新检查有效性。","x":980,"y":1450,"width":420,"height":290,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"cleanup-detach","type":"text","text":"## 回收4：宿主解绑当前Avatar\n创建State仍有效且有CurrentAvatar → DetachAvatar(CurrentAvatar)。\nCombatantState/PawnExtension按ExpectedASC解除关系，保留Owner并清ASC Avatar/本地缓存。\nEncounter不写ActorInfo，不复制解绑链。\n当前Avatar可以是外部Pawn；这里只解绑，不登记销毁责任。\n[[Combatants/结构|宿主契约]]","x":1480,"y":1450,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"cleanup-destroy","type":"text","text":"## 回收5：仅销毁创建对象\n从先前创建快照依序Destroy：初始Avatar → Controller → State。\n每步重新IsValid，提前失效对象跳过。\n初始Avatar Owner改变仍回收；外部Avatar Owner指向Encounter也保留。\n创建记录已空，重复/重入清理不重复释放；统一清理结束后退出守卫。\n14b完整构建/两专项通过；真实BT/PIE/联机待验，E9完整动态未验。","x":1980,"y":1450,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"1"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"spawn","fromSide":"right","toNode":"bind","toSide":"left","label":"已记录三创建对象，PawnData就绪"},
		{"id":"e2","fromNode":"bind","fromSide":"right","toNode":"brain","toSide":"left","label":"Attach/Finish/Possess一致；配置BT才进入决策"},
		{"id":"e3","fromNode":"brain","fromSide":"right","toNode":"ga","toSide":"left","label":"一次性来源身份 + 原 SpecHandle"},
		{"id":"e4","fromNode":"ga","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"future","toSide":"top","label":"目标：阶段条件成立后进入事务"},
		{"id":"e5","fromNode":"future","fromSide":"right","toNode":"persist","toSide":"left","label":"目标保持状态连续"},
		{"id":"e-spawn-rollback","fromNode":"spawn","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"spawn-rollback","toSide":"top","label":"生成/配置/回调复核失败"},
		{"id":"e-bind-rollback","fromNode":"bind","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"spawn-rollback","toSide":"top","label":"绑定/Finish/Possess后失效"},
		{"id":"e-endplay-cleanup","fromNode":"cleanup-trigger","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"cleanup-clear","toSide":"top","label":"EndPlay复用统一清理"},
		{"id":"e-rollback-cleanup","fromNode":"spawn-rollback","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"cleanup-clear","toSide":"top","label":"FailSpawn复用统一清理"},
		{"id":"e-cleanup-stop","fromNode":"cleanup-clear","fromSide":"right","toNode":"cleanup-stop","toSide":"left","label":"清引用后才进入外部回调"},
		{"id":"e-stop-unpossess","fromNode":"cleanup-stop","fromSide":"right","toNode":"cleanup-unpossess","toSide":"left","label":"停止请求在解绑前"},
		{"id":"e-unpossess-detach","fromNode":"cleanup-unpossess","fromSide":"right","toNode":"cleanup-detach","toSide":"left","label":"Controller解除关系后"},
		{"id":"e-detach-destroy","fromNode":"cleanup-detach","fromSide":"right","toNode":"cleanup-destroy","toSide":"left","label":"宿主解绑后仅回收创建对象"}
	]
}
